  data: {
    LLM: "Identify the high cards in the dummies early. Use your hand to support your dummy's weak suits and vice-versa.\n\nDeduction: Since you see your hand and the top cards of both dummies, you can calculate the probabilities of hidden cards in the face-down stacks vs. the opponent's hand.\n\nEndplay setup: Force the opponent to uncover their dummy cards in a specific order, potentially trapping their high cards under your own established winners.",
